<title>KAZAKHSTAN: Kazakh tenge falls to 70.5927 to dlr.</title>
<headline>Kazakh tenge falls to 70.5927 to dlr.</headline>
<dateline>ALMATY 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The tenge fell to 70.5927 per dollar on the Kazakhstan Currency Exchange 70.4551 on Monday.</p>
<p>				     Nov 5		   Nov 4</p>
<p>    tenge per dollar	  70.5927		 70.4551</p>
<p>    volume ($ million)	 5.995		   8.415</p>
<p>    tenge per mark	    46.7214		 46.4000</p>
<p>    volume (DM million)	0.035		   0.200</p>
<p>--Almaty newsroom, +7 3272 509410</p>
